# Dataset

This project uses the Kaggle Loan Default Prediction dataset.

The dataset contains borrower and loan-level variables including:

- Income
- LoanAmount
- CreditScore
- InterestRate
- DTIRatio
- EmploymentType
- LoanPurpose
- Default

The raw dataset is not redistributed in this repository. Download it from the original Kaggle source and place it in this folder as:

`Loan_default.csv`
